<title>USA: CPAC sets share buyback.</title>
<headline>CPAC sets share buyback.</headline>
<dateline>LEICESTER, N.Y. 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>CPAC Inc said Monday its board had authorized the repurchase of up to five percent of its common stock.</p>
<p>The purchases are to be made from time to time in the open market or through privately negotiated transactions with cash on hand.</p>
<p>CPAC is a specialty chemical manufacturer operating in cleaning and personal care under its brand name Fuller Brush Co, and in imaging.</p>
